    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/2da19e877a344608e46ee61534352249.poster.avif?t=1639462726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/2da19e877a344608e46ee61534352249.webm?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/2da19e877a344608e46ee61534352249.mp4?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Active Crowds</strong> is a physics-based strategy game where you can interact with large groups of people. Buy traps, bombs, black holes and place them in optimal positions to defend against the flow of human crowds!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tower defence</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/8835dc8e517786cbbb88ff46ddbebe82.poster.avif?t=1639462726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/8835dc8e517786cbbb88ff46ddbebe82.webm?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/8835dc8e517786cbbb88ff46ddbebe82.mp4?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your mission is clear: do everything possible to stop the crowd! Plan your tactics wisely. Given your budget for a level, you need to carefully think what objects to buy and carefully plan the exact spots where you place each object.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Physics based animations!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/0c69fd0e684745a93886958f59964ced.poster.avif?t=1639462726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/0c69fd0e684745a93886958f59964ced.webm?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/0c69fd0e684745a93886958f59964ced.mp4?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A unique experience with\u00a0rigidbody structured characters!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mission: Prevent an Incident</h2> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/e21c5645e8f7231322df0dc3142de1f5.poster.avif?t=1639462726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/e21c5645e8f7231322df0dc3142de1f5.webm?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/e21c5645e8f7231322df0dc3142de1f5.mp4?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Something bad is going to happen. Find out how it occurs and what can be done to prevent it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endless Mode</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/e7bef2fb9ec573cd89eea6cf86f11f39.avif?t=1639462726\" /></div><br>How long can you last against unyielding waves of crowds?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sandbox Mode</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/ff99a457b998c39d91c40c0c18d96501.poster.avif?t=1639462726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/ff99a457b998c39d91c40c0c18d96501.webm?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683050/extras/ff99a457b998c39d91c40c0c18d96501.mp4?t=1639462726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In this mode, you have unlimited resources.  The only limit is your imagination!",
